## Updated mermaid module
New version of Mermaid processor is available from `.mermaid` cells allowing to do much more complex styling: 

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.mermaid
---
config:
  layout: elk
---
flowchart LR
subgraph s1["Raw Commits"]
n1["Branch Main"]
n2["Branch Dev"]
n3["Feature Branches"]
end
s1 --> n4["Merge Conflict Resolver"]
n4 --> n5["Build Pipeline Trigger"]
n8(["Approval Gate"]) --> n5
n5 -- "<span style='padding-left:10px;'>Generate Artifacts Only</span>" --> n7["Docker Image<br>Single Registry Path<br>n Container Versions"]


n1@{ shape: rect}
n2@{ shape: rect}
n3@{ shape: rect}

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: mermaid
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
---
config:
  layout: elk
---
flowchart LR
subgraph s1["Raw Commits"]
n1["Branch Main"]
n2["Branch Dev"]
n3["Feature Branches"]
end
s1 --> n4["Merge Conflict Resolver"]
n4 --> n5["Build Pipeline Trigger"]
n8(["Approval Gate"]) --> n5
n5 -- "<span style='padding-left:10px;'>Generate Artifacts Only</span>" --> n7["Docker Image<br>Single Registry Path<br>n Container Versions"]


n1@{ shape: rect}
n2@{ shape: rect}
n3@{ shape: rect}

